  "details": "VRCPhysBone works correctly on PC and in the Unity editor using Android/Quest build target.\n\nOn Meta Quest standalone, the PhysBone simulation itself works normally, but the user cannot grab the PhysBone.\n\nQuest users also cannot see the PhysBone being grabbed/moved by a PC user.\n\nPC users can grab and move the same PhysBone normally.\n\nTested with:\n\nSeparate PC and Android versions of the same avatar\n\nMatching hierarchy\n\nMatching Network IDs\n\nAllow Grabbing enabled\n\nAllow Posing enabled\n\nFinite Max Stretch\n\nMultiple avatars\n\nMultiple PCs/build environments\n\nMultiple testers\n\nIssue only occurs on the Quest/Android client.",
